E7 gate check — the drill build's live arm (2026-11-01)
One invocation: `tests/e7_gate_check.sh --live` with E7G_DRILL=1 (the default). It builds
sls_operating_system_e3_drill.iso (E3_INIT_FEATURES=e3_envs,e7_gate, E7_SLOW_BOOT=1), boots it
twice, and asserts the gate's clauses and the drill's. Boot 2: the wait outlived the fixed bound
at 3003 ticks with aerosls.posix.1 RUNNING (running=1/2, quiet 0, announced=0), never answered,
and the pour landed — payloads=1, payload_skips=0 — for the resumed copy to reach Done with
172 frame(s) reaped. The recording is reusable: `tests/e7_gate_check.sh --replay <DIR>`.

